Z||000004||Steve Normington||07-09-2001||05:46 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by terryk:<BR><B>What PCM/engine is it?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Engine: 3.4 L Gen III out of a 97 Oldsmobile Silhoutte (VIN code 'E')<BR>PCM: 3.1 L 97 Oldsmobile Achiva (VIN code 'M')<P>My buddy at NAPA says that the computers are the same part number and since they have no PROMs, they shouldn't be any difference between the engine/computer.<P>||||reg||1
